{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>國際時尚品牌CHANEL昨日 (26日) 在首爾盛大舉行2026高級手工坊系列復刻大秀，這是該品牌時隔7年重返韓國活動。是次活動現場星光熠熠，除了潮流教父權志龍（G-Dragon）與奧斯卡影后Marion Cotillard之外，還有BLACKPINK成員Jennie、金高銀等韓星現身。Jennie更成為當晚全場焦點所在，她身穿品牌2027早春度假系列黑白深V無袖褲裝亮相，搭配復古波浪長捲髮與紅唇，造型集性感與優雅於一身。</p><figure><img alt=\"Jennie好靚。(影片截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136295053799591936579431.jpeg/XjgQVTAli1sjXJIlLjtpnB0DAsZ4gOaJATsyYgE7MmI\"/><figcaption>Jennie好靚。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jennie好靚。(影片截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136295051370958848304192.jpeg/UiyAyu-ySEcPU77hVHUvnhf4mBNa_SXE8SQQ6_EkEOs\"/><figcaption>Jennie好靚。(影片截圖)</figcaption></figure><p>任由外籍男造型師觸踫</p><p>有網民於Threads就上載了一段當日Jennie在抵達活動現場之前的片段。片中可見Jennie乘坐7人車抵步，身穿該套性感服裝的她下車後，即有一名疑似是服裝造型師的外籍男士上前為她整理衣服，期間將手放到她的胸前為她整理，Jennie欣然接受對方的幫忙，絲毫沒有表現抗拒或感到尷尬，全程落落大方，盡顯不拘小節又Open的一面。</p><figure><img alt=\"Jennie落車。(threads截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136299913169604608728450.jpeg/8tgBoxBSoJI_JAxpCtJJAM7p3wzdoPzRd2i33Hdot9w\"/><figcaption>Jennie落車。(threads截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jennie讓外籍男造型師整理。(threads截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136299910615142400906527.jpeg/Wdf_sQJscWMWxgkh5JHNKJcDdp_1F6oHL4FKuS-BSrk\"/><figcaption>Jennie讓外籍男造型師整理。(threads截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jennie好大方。(threads截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136299907901296640246139.jpeg/Eu0i2Kl7fO7ix1XrjQ6AV8T9ROde_28wCpVE8wqVRPM\"/><figcaption>Jennie好大方。(threads截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jennie不拘小節。(threads截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136299905267142656489320.jpeg/sdHbjt1A3kyezrT5OcUjBwziAnmv8HezhieQnYYnkJ0\"/><figcaption>Jennie不拘小節。(threads截圖)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jennie好open。(threads截圖)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136299902624600064051627.jpeg/ijdbh3fWWSYeKnbkjF4zW7jF_Lft1Mxp0v2UVNL9lFQ\"/><figcaption>Jennie好open。(threads截圖)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-27T10:21:32.249196+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":538,"images":7,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}